WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Narrator: Watch Faisal.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:13.000
Narrator: Hold, look, wait for the gap, show the sign, check every lane, call them across, stay until the last fan, and return to the kerb.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.900
Narrator: When the crowd grows, he radios early.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Narrator: Calm and in control.
